{
  "_note": [
    "Synthetic example request groups for MINERVA's dispatch scheduler, in the OCS request language",
    "(robofast_core/request_model.py; field by field in docs/request_language.md). The legacy MINERVA",
    "target lists are not in the public minerva-control repository, so these are illustrative:",
    "well-known RV-standard stars (J2000 coordinates, rounded; ra and dec in degrees) as legacy observed",
    "them -- standing requests (extra_params.cadence) at least 3 h apart, at most 2 visits a night (the",
    "legacy seplimit and maxobs defaults) -- plus a telluric B star and a one-shot imaging request for T2.",
    "Convert a real legacy targets.csv with robofast_core.request_model.from_legacy_csv, or name it",
    "as 'legacy_csv' in the dispatch plan entry (sites/minerva/dispatch.example.json)."
